with your own character\n**1. Train once:** connect photos of one person to *Soul ID (train character)*, turn on **start_training**, run. (Training may use credits.)\n**2. Generate:** *Soul ID list* finds the character by name and feeds its ID into Soul 2.\nRight-click Soul 2 → **Pick Soul 2 style…** for styles.\n\n**Cost safety**\n1. Press **Run** with **run = estimate only** — the node shows the exact price (free).\n2. Set **run = generate** to create it. **max cost (USD)** blocks anything above the limit.\n\nAPI key: *Settings → Higgsfield → API key*."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### Soul 2 with your own character\n**1. Train once:** connect photos of one person to *Soul ID (train character)*, turn on **start_training**, run. (Training may use credits.)\n**2. Generate:** *Soul ID list* finds the character by name and feeds its ID into Soul 2.\nRight-click Soul 2 → **Pick Soul 2 style…** for styles.\n\n**Cost safety**\n1. Press **Run** with **run = estimate only** — the node shows the exact price (free).\n2. Set **run = generate** to create it. **max cost (USD)** blocks anything above the limit.\n\nAPI key: *Settings → Higgsfield → API key*."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[1,1,0,2,4,"STRING"],[2,2,0,3,0,"IMAGE"],[3,4,0,5,0,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":1,"offset":[0,0]}},"version":0.4}